WEBVTT

00:17.360 --> 00:20.520
How do we measure our existence?

00:21.520 --> 00:24.800
By fame or the number of your viewers?

00:30.280 --> 00:33.560
We exist as long as people
are watching us.

00:38.080 --> 00:41.680
But what must we sacrifice
to get people's attention?

00:45.360 --> 00:46.600
I want to die.

02:21.680 --> 02:24.280
Hello, there. This is JennyX.

02:24.360 --> 02:26.320
I was almost late
for our livestream tonight.

02:26.400 --> 02:28.960
I've been so crazy busy with school work.

02:29.040 --> 02:31.040
I also have exams coming up.

02:31.120 --> 02:33.120
But I didn't want
to keep you all waiting.

02:33.200 --> 02:36.080
So, I thought I'd get all my homework done
while talking with you all.

02:38.920 --> 02:40.560
YOU KEEP ME FOCUSED IN SCHOOL.

02:40.640 --> 02:42.600
YOU'RE SO BANGABLE.

02:42.680 --> 02:44.280
Hmm.

02:45.280 --> 02:46.680
This one's hard.

02:46.760 --> 02:49.800
I don't know if I'll be able to solve it.
Can anyone out there help me?

02:49.880 --> 02:51.920
I DON'T BELIEVE YOU. YOU GOT THIS.
I'LL HELP YOU.

02:52.000 --> 02:53.960
I can't solve it right now.
Give me a second.

02:55.840 --> 02:57.720
Hmm.

02:59.680 --> 03:00.960
IT'S REALLY HARD. - WOW.

03:05.600 --> 03:09.400
I got it. I think I got the answer.

03:12.400 --> 03:15.040
I almost couldn't solve it.

03:15.120 --> 03:18.240
What about you?
Have you finished your homework?

03:18.320 --> 03:20.680
If you haven't done it yet,
then we should do it together.

03:21.240 --> 03:24.760
I want my channel to be the place
where we can all help each other out.

03:25.400 --> 03:27.960
Or if anyone needs my help,
please tell me.

03:28.040 --> 03:30.760
If there's ever any way I can help you,
I totally will.

03:32.320 --> 03:34.720
POLICE ARE SAVING SOMEONE
WHO'S ATTEMPTING SUICIDE.

03:34.800 --> 03:35.800
WHERE?

03:35.880 --> 03:37.200
GO TO WWW.LIVENEWS.COM

03:41.800 --> 03:44.880
Hey. Has everyone left
to do their homework?

03:47.440 --> 03:49.680
N. - I'M ALWAYS HERE WITH YOU.

03:53.160 --> 03:54.680
TELL PEOPLE TO GO SUPPORT THE POLICE.

03:56.960 --> 03:59.480
Oh, no. An emergency.
Has something happened?

04:00.040 --> 04:03.280
I'm so worried.
I hope everyone is going to be okay.

04:05.000 --> 04:06.320
I've got an idea.

04:06.400 --> 04:08.920
Let's all go give the police our support.

04:09.000 --> 04:11.320
I'll go give them my support too.

04:11.400 --> 04:13.120
I'll do another livestream soon.

04:13.200 --> 04:15.120
I look forward to doing my homework
with you then.

04:15.760 --> 04:17.480
I'll see you again soon. Bye bye.

04:17.560 --> 04:20.160
N. - I'LL BE WAITING
NO MATTER HOW LATE IT IS.

04:21.440 --> 04:24.400
Why did you make me stop so soon?

04:24.480 --> 04:25.640
We could've gotten more views.

04:25.720 --> 04:28.440
Oh, we couldn't get the views up
after that.

04:28.520 --> 04:31.400
That suicide is trending number one
on Twitter.

04:31.480 --> 04:32.440
Ugh.

04:32.520 --> 04:35.040
Will we still get
the endorsement fee for the drink?

04:35.120 --> 04:37.400
She didn't even mention
the product's name.

04:37.480 --> 04:39.760
They only gave us half of the payment
upfront this time.

04:39.840 --> 04:41.160
If we don't finish the job--

04:41.240 --> 04:43.600
But I'm tired.

04:43.680 --> 04:46.240
How about I make you some coffee, huh?

04:46.320 --> 04:48.360
All right? Be right back, okay?

04:48.440 --> 04:50.640
Don't bother. Both of you leave.

04:50.720 --> 04:51.960
Hmm?

04:59.280 --> 05:00.480
This is bullshit.

05:18.040 --> 05:19.720
-Look.
-She's here.

05:19.800 --> 05:20.640
Hello, Mon!

05:20.720 --> 05:22.160
Oh, my. Oh, my.

05:22.240 --> 05:23.480
How are you doing?

05:23.560 --> 05:24.920
Yeah, hi, Jane.

05:26.120 --> 05:28.520
Wow.

05:28.600 --> 05:30.960
What did you do?
Why did she say hello to you?

05:31.040 --> 05:33.080
-Yeah, tell us.
-Well, I just left a compliment

05:33.160 --> 05:34.520
on her live stream the other day.

05:34.600 --> 05:36.960
She's so cool and nice.

05:37.040 --> 05:38.000
Hello, Cake!

05:38.080 --> 05:40.600
How's your sprained wrist?
Is it still hurting?

05:40.680 --> 05:43.200
Oh, it's already healed.
Thanks for asking.

05:47.320 --> 05:49.800
-She remembered.
-She remembers me.

05:52.720 --> 05:53.800
Oh, Non!

05:54.960 --> 05:56.840
How's your mom? Is she still sick?

05:57.440 --> 06:00.000
If there's anything I can do,
please let me know.

06:00.080 --> 06:01.320
Okay, thank you so much.

06:04.520 --> 06:05.960
Damn, dude.

06:06.040 --> 06:09.520
Jane remembers things about you, Non.
I'm so jealous of you.

06:09.600 --> 06:11.600
-Hi, Jane.
-Hello.

06:32.000 --> 06:34.000
Excuse me. You're sitting in my seat.

06:39.400 --> 06:41.320
Jane? JennyX, is that you?

06:42.080 --> 06:45.600
Are you really in this class?
I'm so happy.

06:45.680 --> 06:48.040
I've been a big fan of yours
for a long time now.

06:48.120 --> 06:51.320
I never thought, when I moved here,
we'd be classmates.

06:51.400 --> 06:53.920
Hmm… it's nice to meet you too.

06:55.080 --> 06:58.000
I watch your livestreams
no matter how late they are.

07:00.520 --> 07:03.320
Hey, do you go by "N" online?

07:04.160 --> 07:05.520
You know who I am?

07:06.200 --> 07:10.080
I'm surprised someone like you remembers
a faceless fan like me.

07:10.640 --> 07:13.560
Hmm… I think every person is memorable.

07:14.120 --> 07:15.680
Oh…

07:15.760 --> 07:19.080
your words are so touching.
You really are JennyX.

07:20.400 --> 07:23.360
Anyway, is this seat assigned to you?

07:24.200 --> 07:25.120
Yes.

07:25.200 --> 07:28.480
Can I have it? I really love sitting here.

07:28.560 --> 07:31.680
There's an empty seat back there.

07:33.680 --> 07:36.040
Oh… fine.

07:41.400 --> 07:45.280
You can be honest. You can tell me
if you're not okay with it.

07:46.360 --> 07:49.800
You don't have to do
anything you don't want to do.

07:53.680 --> 07:56.120
I've been your fan for a long time now,

07:56.200 --> 07:59.280
and I check your Instagram posts everyday
and watch all your livestreams.

08:00.640 --> 08:04.680
You know, I see what's going on.
I can see that you're not happy.

08:07.160 --> 08:09.520
No, really. I promise you I'm fine.

08:10.360 --> 08:12.880
I don't mind sitting here.
Really, it's okay.

08:15.280 --> 08:16.960
Go back to your seat, Jane.

08:20.320 --> 08:23.360
I can see that you don't really
wanna sit here.

08:24.280 --> 08:25.400
Am I right?

08:28.760 --> 08:33.080
When you're with me, you can be honest
and say how you're really feeling.

08:35.640 --> 08:38.160
I don't want you to be lonely anymore.

08:42.520 --> 08:46.960
That's how you calculate
half life from a half life graph.

08:47.040 --> 08:50.880
The next problem is about
a velocity-time graph.

08:50.960 --> 08:54.640
The slope of a velocity-time graph

08:54.720 --> 08:57.640
represents the acceleration of the object.

08:59.040 --> 09:01.040
Jane,
do you want to sit with us?

09:01.720 --> 09:02.560
Uh…

09:02.640 --> 09:05.080
Will you live-stream yourself
doing homework today?

09:05.160 --> 09:06.640
I don't know yet.

09:06.720 --> 09:09.760
I'm so jealous. How does it feel
to have so many followers?

09:09.840 --> 09:12.240
Well, I just did it for fun at first.

09:12.320 --> 09:14.840
-I never thought I'd get many followers.
-Huh.

09:14.920 --> 09:16.960
How much do you get paid
to endorse a product?

09:19.000 --> 09:21.440
I don't really know.
My parents take care of that for me.

09:21.520 --> 09:23.080
-Oh.
-Jane!

09:23.840 --> 09:26.360
Can you come over here?
I need your help with something.

09:26.440 --> 09:28.640
Uh… bring your lunch too.

09:29.800 --> 09:31.040
Excuse me.

09:32.000 --> 09:33.680
Never mind. I got her picture.

09:33.760 --> 09:35.920
-Gosh. Jane is so pretty.
-Wow.

09:42.120 --> 09:44.400
So, what did you want me to help you with?

09:45.120 --> 09:46.600
Nothing really.

09:46.680 --> 09:49.480
You just seemed
so uncomfortable over there.

09:50.080 --> 09:51.760
I would be uncomfortable too.

09:52.560 --> 09:55.240
Was that a chat or an interview?
I couldn't tell.

10:00.840 --> 10:02.480
What kind of food is that?

10:02.560 --> 10:04.040
Why does it look like shit?

10:04.720 --> 10:07.880
Well, my mom just put me on a diet

10:08.480 --> 10:10.080
to help me stay in shape.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.360
Blech.

10:12.920 --> 10:15.120
It doesn't look good at all.

10:16.160 --> 10:17.640
That's what you're thinking, right?

10:19.840 --> 10:21.520
Mmm-hmm.

10:21.600 --> 10:24.360
Eat this instead. It's so good.

10:29.080 --> 10:30.000
Should I?

10:30.080 --> 10:31.280
Mmm-hmm.

10:33.440 --> 10:34.720
Come on.

10:39.040 --> 10:40.120
Mmm…

10:40.840 --> 10:42.960
I haven't eaten
this kind of food in so long.

10:45.160 --> 10:48.600
I think that if you like it
you should have more. Here.

10:48.680 --> 10:50.440
-Mmm…
-Enjoy.

10:52.960 --> 10:55.160
It's fine to eat like this
once in a while.

10:55.240 --> 10:57.680
Everyone needs to do
what they want sometimes

10:58.360 --> 11:00.320
without having to worry about anything.

11:02.400 --> 11:04.520
You don't have to be perfect all the time.

11:04.600 --> 11:08.480
I want you to remember,
you can be yourself with me.

11:10.600 --> 11:14.880
When we're together, you don't have
to be JennyX. I won't judge you.

11:22.240 --> 11:27.040
You know, this snack that you reviewed,
it's not even good.

11:27.120 --> 11:28.560
Do you think I liked it?

11:28.640 --> 11:32.280
When I was eating it, I had to have
a trash can by me. It made me gag.

11:32.360 --> 11:34.080
But this is what I have to do.

11:34.640 --> 11:37.320
Hello, everyone. This snack is so good.

11:42.000 --> 11:44.280
Mmm. And that one.

11:44.360 --> 11:46.000
It made me break out so bad,

11:46.080 --> 11:47.480
I covered it with make up for days.

11:48.080 --> 11:52.080
And your parents? Don't they screen
the products first before you review them?

11:54.320 --> 11:55.640
My parents?

11:55.720 --> 11:58.960
They have me review anything
as long as I get paid.

11:59.040 --> 12:02.480
Jane, someone wants to hire you
to review some kitchenware.

12:02.560 --> 12:04.240
You'll even get to cook.

12:04.920 --> 12:07.280
They have me do anything
that earns them money.

12:08.800 --> 12:11.880
They don't care if it's late
or if I'm tired.

12:11.960 --> 12:14.160
These face masks are really the best.

12:14.720 --> 12:15.960
No one's paying me to say this.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.800
I promise, I even use them myself.

12:17.880 --> 12:21.320
I have to lie to everyone and
tell them that these are amazing products.

12:21.400 --> 12:23.280
…four, five, six, seven.

12:23.360 --> 12:24.320
Wow.

12:24.400 --> 12:28.280
May God bless us.
We made so much money this month.

12:29.840 --> 12:33.360
Honey, Jane's birthday's coming up.
What should we get her?

12:34.720 --> 12:36.040
Hmm.

12:36.960 --> 12:38.880
How about cellphone?
She said she wanted one.

12:40.480 --> 12:41.840
Hmm.

12:42.600 --> 12:46.200
How about we buy her more followers?
She will get more sponsors.

12:46.280 --> 12:48.680
We might be able to negotiate
a higher fee for her.

12:53.280 --> 12:55.840
Hmm. Good idea.

12:55.920 --> 12:58.400
Let's do that.
Can you check how much it costs?

12:58.480 --> 12:59.760
Screw them.

13:06.360 --> 13:10.480
I guess being famous,
it isn't as great as I thought.

13:10.560 --> 13:15.880
My followers, they want a role model.
They always want me to act happy.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.160
As for my haters,

13:17.240 --> 13:19.480
they think they can post
whatever they want about me,

13:19.560 --> 13:22.040
because I have an image
of being a nice person.

13:22.120 --> 13:25.080
I have to be kind and understanding
towards everyone.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.600
It makes me wanna vomit.

13:31.040 --> 13:34.440
So, what is it that
you actually want to do?

13:35.480 --> 13:38.760
I want… to run away from everything.

13:39.720 --> 13:44.120
I'm sick of being happy all the time
or caring what they think.

13:44.920 --> 13:47.280
I'm sick of my parents treating me
like a product.

13:47.840 --> 13:50.040
Basically, I'm sick of being JennyX.

13:50.120 --> 13:53.480
I'm done with it.
I want to disappear from this world.

13:54.480 --> 13:59.720
Ah, you want to disappear from this world.
Do you really mean that?

13:59.800 --> 14:01.280
Mmm. I do.

14:02.080 --> 14:05.240
But I don't think it's really possible.

14:06.720 --> 14:10.720
Well, if you want, there's a way
you can make that happen.

14:10.800 --> 14:13.440
Are you saying that I should
run away from home?

14:14.360 --> 14:17.720
I can't go out anywhere in public anymore

14:17.800 --> 14:19.280
without being recognized.

14:20.200 --> 14:23.480
Even if I could, my parents…

14:28.200 --> 14:29.360
track me with this.

14:37.080 --> 14:39.240
I wasn't saying you should run away
from home.

14:43.240 --> 14:45.760
You should consider leaving this world
all together.

14:56.200 --> 14:57.480
Is Jane home, honey?

15:02.400 --> 15:03.240
Yes, she is.

15:03.320 --> 15:04.920
Oh, that's good.

15:25.400 --> 15:28.080
Hello, everyone! It's Jane.

15:28.160 --> 15:31.560
Today, I have something important
to share with you.

15:31.640 --> 15:33.200
Let me tell you about my feelings.

15:33.280 --> 15:34.680
Oh. She's live early today.

15:34.760 --> 15:37.360
-…what I want to do with my life.
-Is everything okay, honey?

15:37.440 --> 15:38.760
Yeah. She's just doing it for fun.

15:39.520 --> 15:43.400
When you hear me say that,
you think those are my dreams.

15:43.480 --> 15:45.200
YOU'RE SENTIMENTAL TODAY.
I'M GOING TO CRY.

15:45.280 --> 15:46.120
But you know what?

15:46.200 --> 15:47.640
THIS IS DIFFERENT. - DON'T TEASE US.

15:47.720 --> 15:49.840
Every time I try dreaming…

15:49.920 --> 15:52.400
I just feel completely empty.

15:54.520 --> 15:57.040
That's because everyday…

15:57.720 --> 16:00.280
I don't have any time
to think about myself.

16:01.760 --> 16:05.880
I spend all of my time
reviewing all these crappy products.

16:06.520 --> 16:09.520
Do you think these products
are really good?

16:10.600 --> 16:12.880
What the hell does she think she's doing?

16:14.280 --> 16:15.360
Jane, what are you doing?

16:17.720 --> 16:20.520
Jane, open the door. Jane!

16:20.600 --> 16:21.920
Honey, go get the key.

16:22.520 --> 16:24.360
Jane, it's your dad. Open the door!

16:25.040 --> 16:26.760
I have to lie to you all.

16:27.640 --> 16:29.200
Do you want to know why?

16:29.280 --> 16:30.920
TELL US WHO HURT YOU.

16:31.000 --> 16:32.480
I'VE NEVER SEEN YOU LIKE THIS.

16:32.560 --> 16:35.040
TELL US WHO HURT YOU.

16:35.120 --> 16:38.800
DON'T CRY, JANE. - YOU POOR THING.

16:38.880 --> 16:42.640
TELL US, JANE. - HANG IN THERE. - DAMN.

16:43.800 --> 16:47.600
It's because my parents don't know
how to earn money themselves.

16:47.680 --> 16:49.480
They use me to make money for them.

16:49.560 --> 16:51.280
Jane!

16:51.360 --> 16:53.120
THEY'RE ABUSIVE PARENTS.
CAPITALISM IS EVIL.

16:53.200 --> 16:55.280
THAT'S SO LOW.
I FEEL BAD FOR YOU, JANE.

16:55.360 --> 16:58.520
But I'm sick of lying to everyone, okay?

16:58.600 --> 16:59.760
TOUGHEN UP OR GIVE UP.

16:59.840 --> 17:01.040
HEY! - YOU LYING BITCH.

17:01.120 --> 17:03.960
I'm sick of doing things
I don't want to do.

17:04.600 --> 17:06.440
I'm mad. Mad, mad, mad, mad.

17:06.520 --> 17:08.680
-Jane!
-Mad, mad, mad, mad, mad!

17:08.760 --> 17:09.760
Honey.

17:14.080 --> 17:15.120
Jane!

17:18.720 --> 17:23.200
But when realized I don't want
to do any of this anymore,

17:23.280 --> 17:25.280
one thought popped into my head.

17:25.920 --> 17:27.480
And I knew immediately

17:28.120 --> 17:29.200
that's what I'll do.

17:31.560 --> 17:32.840
CALM DOWN, JANE.

17:32.920 --> 17:34.040
I want to die.

17:34.120 --> 17:35.720
Hello, officer.

17:35.800 --> 17:38.840
My daughter's live-streaming her own
suicide, but I don't know where she is.

17:38.920 --> 17:40.960
I need you to track the location
of her phone for me.

17:41.600 --> 17:42.920
It's JennyX.

17:43.000 --> 17:43.960
CALM DOWN, JANE.

17:44.040 --> 17:46.040
YOU JUST SAY THAT TO GET ATTENTION.

17:46.120 --> 17:47.880
NO, JANE. - SHE WOULDN'T DARE.

17:48.720 --> 17:50.880
YOU ATTENTION SEEKER.

17:50.960 --> 17:54.200
If I do this, where do you think I should…

17:54.280 --> 17:55.720
cut myself, everyone?

17:56.520 --> 17:59.720
Should I cut my wrist, stab myself,

18:00.920 --> 18:02.280
or slit my throat?

18:04.480 --> 18:06.120
You have to help me decide.

18:07.080 --> 18:08.840
I can't stand living like this anymore.

18:08.920 --> 18:10.560
Officer, please hurry up.

18:10.640 --> 18:11.880
Now, I have an idea.

18:11.960 --> 18:13.080
CUT YOUR THROAT IF YOU DARE.

18:13.160 --> 18:15.880
Click "like" for the wrist.
"Wow" for the chest.

18:15.960 --> 18:17.480
THINK THIS THROUGH, JANE.

18:17.560 --> 18:19.600
For the throat, click on the "heart."

18:19.680 --> 18:21.160
DON'T DO THIS. - HEART ALL THE WAY.

18:22.640 --> 18:25.000
ARE YOU SERIOUS?
CUT YOUR THROAT AND DIE.

18:25.080 --> 18:27.080
CUT YOUR THROAT AND DIE.
YOU CAN TALK TO ME, JANE.

18:27.160 --> 18:30.600
Oh, the wrist. That's getting the votes.

18:31.200 --> 18:33.560
Um, but I don't think that will kill me.

18:36.520 --> 18:39.800
Thank you so much for all your votes.
You helped me choose.

18:39.880 --> 18:41.520
I'm really gonna miss you all.

18:42.840 --> 18:44.960
DON'T DO IT, JANE. - NO, JANE. - FINALLY.

18:45.040 --> 18:46.640
-Jane!
-No! No!

18:48.640 --> 18:50.080
Jane!

18:50.160 --> 18:51.680
OH, MY GOD.

18:51.760 --> 18:53.280
SHE DID IT. - JANE.

18:53.360 --> 18:55.920
Stop asking me, you asshole!

18:56.000 --> 18:59.520
She just killed herself!

18:59.600 --> 19:02.200
Jane!

19:02.280 --> 19:05.280
My baby! Jane!

19:20.560 --> 19:21.880
That was very professional.

19:21.960 --> 19:24.280
You really are a top internet star.

19:26.000 --> 19:27.120
Let me help you.

19:29.160 --> 19:32.880
Well, if you want, there's a way
you can make that happen.

19:35.120 --> 19:36.200
How?

19:38.160 --> 19:40.640
You just have to kill yourself, Jane.

19:44.760 --> 19:46.640
I don't mean you actually have to die.

19:47.360 --> 19:50.600
I'm just saying that you should fake
your death.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.080
Thank you.

20:02.440 --> 20:03.560
Is Jane home, Honey?

20:03.640 --> 20:04.840
Yes, she is.

20:16.360 --> 20:17.480
Wow.

20:17.560 --> 20:21.560
Now, your parents will have no idea
that you weren't actually at home.

20:23.680 --> 20:27.440
By the time they realize it,
everything will be over.

20:29.040 --> 20:32.160
Here are all the tools you can use
to kill yourself.

20:33.000 --> 20:35.040
Choose your favorite.
Which one do you like?

20:50.520 --> 20:51.840
You're finally free.

20:52.560 --> 20:55.360
You don't even have to use
the name Jane anymore.

20:56.400 --> 20:59.800
From now on, what would you like
to call yourself?

21:02.080 --> 21:03.440
I like the name "Rosie."

21:33.080 --> 21:34.080
Check in, please.

21:34.800 --> 21:35.880
Just a moment.

21:35.960 --> 21:38.520
Can we get an interview?
Can you give a statement?

21:38.600 --> 21:40.160
-What do you have to say?
-Ugh.

21:40.240 --> 21:44.120
First of all, my wife and I would like
to say to anyone watching

21:44.200 --> 21:47.280
that we're both devastated
by what happened to Jane.

21:48.040 --> 21:50.200
We also have something to say.

21:50.280 --> 21:53.040
We'd like to beg everyone to stop sharing
Jane's suicide clip

21:53.120 --> 21:54.200
out of respect for her.

21:54.280 --> 21:57.640
Do you want people to stop
sharing the clip because of what she said

21:57.720 --> 22:00.800
about product endorsement deals
and what the two of you made her do?

22:00.880 --> 22:02.680
You can say anything you want about us,

22:03.600 --> 22:05.520
but please you have to believe that

22:05.600 --> 22:07.800
we both truly love and care about her.

22:08.360 --> 22:09.360
Thank you.

22:10.120 --> 22:13.440
To every citizen out there, if you happen
to have seen the girl in this picture

22:13.520 --> 22:17.320
anywhere on the Friday evening
before she live-streamed her suicide,

22:17.400 --> 22:18.920
please let us know.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.400
Thank you very much.

22:26.280 --> 22:27.320
So, miss…

22:27.400 --> 22:28.520
Huh?

22:32.960 --> 22:34.400
That's a nice hair color.

22:35.520 --> 22:36.800
Thank you.

22:38.000 --> 22:38.840
Wait.

22:38.920 --> 22:40.160
Yeah?

22:44.040 --> 22:45.960
Did it hurt getting a tattoo?

22:47.680 --> 22:49.760
Oh, not really.

22:49.840 --> 22:50.960
Just itchy.

22:51.040 --> 22:52.200
Yeah.

22:54.320 --> 22:55.640
Here you are.

22:55.720 --> 22:57.280
Mmm.

23:08.360 --> 23:11.960
People are talking about JennyX
even more than they were before.

23:12.720 --> 23:15.120
I know. I didn't expect that.

23:15.200 --> 23:18.840
But it's okay.
We'll soon forget all about JennyX.

23:20.800 --> 23:26.280
They will move on and someone new will
replace you. Everyone will forget you

23:27.120 --> 23:30.320
faster than you expect.
And when that happens…

23:30.400 --> 23:32.200
You'll really be free.

23:34.800 --> 23:35.640
Mmm-hmm.

23:39.520 --> 23:42.800
Hey, I bought you some soy milk.

23:43.440 --> 23:45.000
Drink some and get some sleep.

23:45.800 --> 23:49.680
Oh, thank you.
But I'm allergic to soy milk.

24:25.640 --> 24:27.400
THE NUMBER ONE TREND #WEMISSJENNYX

24:27.480 --> 24:28.360
LIVE STREAM DECEIT

24:28.440 --> 24:32.680
We've found the site of Jane's
suicide, but her body is missing.

24:33.320 --> 24:35.360
Her suicide may have been faked.

24:36.120 --> 24:40.440
The press received a tip
from a tenth-grader named…

24:41.280 --> 24:42.280
Yuri.

24:50.200 --> 24:54.520
This seems to be the place where JennyX
live-streamed her suicide.

24:54.600 --> 24:58.280
Will the famous internet star's suicide
turn out to be nothing but a big fake?

24:58.360 --> 25:01.000
Didn't we get rid
of everything in that room?

25:01.560 --> 25:03.320
Maybe someone came in

25:04.040 --> 25:06.320
and put everything back in place
after we left.

25:08.040 --> 25:11.920
LIVE INTERVIEW OF A CLOSE FRIEND
OF THE INTERNET CELEBRITY

25:12.000 --> 25:14.080
I was so shocked when I found this place.

25:14.160 --> 25:16.840
I couldn't believe Jane would do
something like this.

25:16.920 --> 25:19.880
I'm actually very close to her.
We're best friends.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.800
Jane was a very kind

25:21.880 --> 25:23.520
-and gentle person.
-Who is this girl?

25:23.600 --> 25:25.520
I've never even seen her before today.

25:25.600 --> 25:28.160
Do you think Jane's suicide was faked?

25:31.760 --> 25:34.120
I believe a kind and sweet girl like Jane

25:34.200 --> 25:36.400
couldn't think of something
like this herself.

25:36.480 --> 25:39.160
Someone else must be behind this.
I'm sure of it.

25:42.920 --> 25:44.520
In order to uncover the truth,

25:44.600 --> 25:47.800
I've created my own YouTube channel.
It's called…

25:47.880 --> 25:50.440
"The Truth About Jane by Yuri."

25:50.520 --> 25:52.720
Please like, share, and subscribe
to my channel

25:52.800 --> 25:54.360
and let's find out the truth together.

25:54.440 --> 25:55.720
What the fuck is going on?

25:56.760 --> 25:58.720
If people find out about this,
I'm screwed.

26:00.320 --> 26:03.480
Why aren't you saying anything?
You're the one who told me to do this.

26:04.120 --> 26:05.560
What do we do now?

26:05.640 --> 26:09.640
Why are you so upset?
As long as no one recognizes you…

26:10.800 --> 26:13.160
it will be like Jane is actually gone.

26:13.240 --> 26:14.840
This is all your fault!

26:22.240 --> 26:26.160
People have been leaving comments
and information on my channel.

26:26.240 --> 26:28.720
I'd like to be the one
to get to the bottom of this.

26:39.680 --> 26:41.920
IT REALLY IS A DIFFERENT ROOM.
GOOD EYE, YURI.

26:42.720 --> 26:46.640
When you're someone's best friend,
you remember details about them.

26:53.640 --> 26:55.040
Do you see this?

27:00.440 --> 27:04.520
Look at this. These must be Jane's
footprints from when she was in this room.

27:04.600 --> 27:07.120
Jane and I wear the same shoe size.
Let's check.

27:08.880 --> 27:11.520
They're the same size exactly.
Do you all see this?

27:11.600 --> 27:14.800
KEEP GOING, YURI.
YOU'RE PRETTY AND SMART.

27:14.880 --> 27:16.360
YOU'RE AWESOME, YURI.

27:22.120 --> 27:25.280
I GO TO THE SAME SCHOOL AS JANE.
I'VE NEVER SEEN YOU BEFORE.

27:25.360 --> 27:27.120
ARE YOU REALLY JANE'S FRIEND?

27:27.200 --> 27:28.920
HERE COMES ANOTHER TROLL.

27:29.000 --> 27:30.600
LOOK HOW CLOSE THEY ARE.

27:30.680 --> 27:33.000
THEY EVEN HAVE THE SAME DEMEANOR.
STOP QUESTIONING HER.

27:33.080 --> 27:36.160
MAYBE IT'S YOU WHO TRICKED JANE.

27:36.240 --> 27:37.800
I have to go right now.

27:37.880 --> 27:41.680
I'll be back soon and we'll discover
the truth about Jane together. Bye bye.

27:57.320 --> 28:01.200
Nothing is scarier
than the truth. Isn't that right, Jane?

28:01.280 --> 28:03.520
Or… should I call you Rosie?

28:04.160 --> 28:06.040
Or… is it Jane?

28:06.120 --> 28:08.160
What do you want? Who are you?

28:08.240 --> 28:11.640
I'm the great detective
who knows the truth about everything.

28:11.720 --> 28:12.760
Yuri?

28:14.120 --> 28:16.560
Aren't I a good liar? 

28:16.640 --> 28:18.680
You'll have to teach me some tips.

28:21.200 --> 28:22.760
Tell me what you want from me.

28:24.680 --> 28:27.040
It's not too late
to change your mind, Jane.

28:27.920 --> 28:30.120
I have a way to get you out of this.

28:31.640 --> 28:32.720
Do you want to meet?

29:14.360 --> 29:16.200
I thought you wouldn't show up, Jane.

29:17.120 --> 29:19.520
Who's Jane? I'm Rosie.

29:21.800 --> 29:24.800
That's right. Rosie.

29:25.800 --> 29:29.240
First, you changed your name,
then what did you do after that?

29:33.320 --> 29:38.200
You got a haircut, a tattoo.
You pierced your nose.

29:38.280 --> 29:39.760
-You bought new clothes--
-Stop.

29:45.480 --> 29:48.560
I have all the pictures. I can prove it.

29:48.640 --> 29:53.720
You went from being Jane
to being this Rosie. Is that right?

29:55.560 --> 29:56.800
What do you want from me?

29:57.520 --> 29:58.400
Money?

30:00.560 --> 30:02.040
If you don't want money, what is it?

30:03.280 --> 30:05.480
I'm trying to help you here.

30:05.560 --> 30:07.680
I know you're working with someone.

30:07.760 --> 30:10.400
Someone that goes by the name
of Nanno, maybe?

30:10.480 --> 30:11.920
She's the real danger.

30:13.280 --> 30:14.720
How do you know Nanno?

30:15.280 --> 30:17.920
I know her better than you do, Rosie.

30:18.920 --> 30:20.480
For example, these pictures…

30:21.280 --> 30:24.320
Who could've taken them besides Nanno?

30:25.400 --> 30:28.040
I hacked these pictures from her cloud.

30:32.240 --> 30:36.280
If you don't believe me, look through
her cellphone and see for yourself.

30:38.000 --> 30:40.000
But let me tell you one thing.

30:40.760 --> 30:42.240
Your only way out…

30:45.160 --> 30:47.040
is to get away from Nanno.

30:48.880 --> 30:52.680
However,
just running away won't be enough,

30:53.400 --> 30:55.920
because Nanno will still be able
to get you.

30:56.560 --> 30:58.640
Then what should I do about her?

31:02.840 --> 31:07.160
I know of one way to keep her quiet.

31:18.080 --> 31:19.560
Understand now?

31:20.240 --> 31:22.720
I only want what's best for you.

31:38.400 --> 31:39.800
Where have you been?

31:43.520 --> 31:45.400
I just wanted to get some fresh air.

31:46.440 --> 31:48.560
Staying in this room is not
what I call freedom.

31:48.640 --> 31:50.520
It's not as fun as I thought it'd be.

31:51.400 --> 31:53.480
Do you want to go back to being JennyX?

31:54.480 --> 31:58.400
Have you forgotten how you are now Rosie?

32:01.840 --> 32:03.760
You should forget about JennyX.

32:04.640 --> 32:07.680
Be patient a little longer
for things to die down.

32:07.760 --> 32:10.160
Then you can live your life
whichever way you want.

32:13.400 --> 32:17.240
I guess you're right. As long as
no one finds proof of what we did.

32:19.080 --> 32:20.880
If Yuri really had any proof,

32:22.320 --> 32:24.120
she would've leaked it by now.

32:26.680 --> 32:33.640
So, do you think there's anyone else
who might have evidence?

32:35.760 --> 32:37.280
I think that…

32:40.440 --> 32:42.320
you're feeling confused right now.

32:49.640 --> 32:51.160
I guess I'm just missing home.

32:56.480 --> 32:57.480
Home?

32:58.720 --> 33:04.640
Do you mean the home where your mom
and dad exploited you for money?

33:06.240 --> 33:09.640
If you do this, you will never go home
or see your parents ever again.

33:10.640 --> 33:11.760
You sure you want that?

33:12.360 --> 33:15.800
I'll be fine. I don't need my parents.

33:15.880 --> 33:18.080
Besides, they're the ones
leeching off of me.

33:18.720 --> 33:21.240
With a family like that,
who needs them anyway?

33:23.360 --> 33:24.680
I'm sorry…

33:26.400 --> 33:29.320
but I don't think you'll be able
to go home ever again.

34:27.960 --> 34:31.880
I've recently discovered
that Jane had a new friend named "Nanno."

34:32.480 --> 34:35.680
Maybe she's the missing link,
the reason behind all of this.

34:35.760 --> 34:37.680
Do you want to know how close they are?

34:39.200 --> 34:44.160
On top of that, I've also found another
set of footprints at the suicide scene.

34:48.760 --> 34:51.040
Do you see there are two sets
of footprints?

34:51.120 --> 34:53.480
I think that one of them belongs to Nanno.

34:54.040 --> 34:56.880
More importantly,
someone has already informed the police

34:56.960 --> 34:59.320
giving them clues
about where these two girls are hiding.

34:59.400 --> 35:01.240
What are you doing?

35:06.280 --> 35:09.440
Uh, I made a mistake.
I don't want to be Rosie anymore.

35:13.040 --> 35:14.680
I already told you.

35:15.920 --> 35:20.280
You should've thought this through
before you did all this, right?

35:21.920 --> 35:25.080
But now you don't have a home anymore.

35:29.680 --> 35:31.240
Come to think of it…

35:33.080 --> 35:34.400
there might be a way.

35:40.320 --> 35:41.320
Nanno.

35:50.760 --> 35:54.280
Just kill me. Do what Yuri told you to do.

35:56.960 --> 36:03.120
By now, your desperate parents
must be missing their darling daughter.

36:05.160 --> 36:07.760
Their precious daughter
has been missing for so long.

36:08.400 --> 36:10.680
Who knows whether she's dead or alive?

36:12.240 --> 36:15.880
And their goody-goody daughter
isn't having fun.

36:17.440 --> 36:19.520
She wants to go back to her old life.

36:21.320 --> 36:22.600
Jane!

36:24.600 --> 36:26.200
This is your only way out.

36:31.280 --> 36:33.280
If you choose to lie…

36:37.560 --> 36:39.360
you have to go all the way.

37:06.560 --> 37:08.080
I killed Nanno.

37:09.160 --> 37:11.000
Nanno is dead.

37:13.160 --> 37:15.240
Shut up and listen, Jane.

37:15.320 --> 37:16.960
You have to mess up the room

37:17.040 --> 37:19.960
and cut yourself a few times
to make it look like you two had a fight.

37:21.000 --> 37:23.840
Then, put the knife
in Nanno's hand to frame her.

37:24.640 --> 37:27.600
After all that,
I think you know what to do.

37:28.200 --> 37:30.120
It's what you're good at.

38:01.520 --> 38:04.000
Somebody help me.

38:04.080 --> 38:07.960
Please help me. I have no idea where I am.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.680
Somebody help me.

38:14.120 --> 38:16.680
Jane, don't worry.
I'm with you now.

38:16.760 --> 38:20.400
Everyone watching, I found Jane.
She's safe now.

38:20.960 --> 38:22.760
What did she do to you, Jane?

38:22.840 --> 38:25.320
It was so horrible, everyone.

38:25.400 --> 38:27.720
She forced me to do all kinds of things.

38:27.800 --> 38:31.160
This, I didn't want
to dye my hair this color.

38:31.240 --> 38:33.760
It's not what I wanted at all.

38:34.600 --> 38:39.560
And… and she also tried to force me
to have sex with her.

38:39.640 --> 38:40.520
Stay away.

38:40.600 --> 38:43.760
But I wouldn't. Then…

38:43.840 --> 38:44.720
Get out.

38:45.280 --> 38:49.280
I took my chance when she wasn't looking.
She was going to attack me, so I…

38:51.640 --> 38:54.080
I swear, it was an accident everyone.

38:54.160 --> 38:56.240
I really didn't mean to do it.

38:56.320 --> 39:01.080
But if I hadn't done that, I…
I never would've gotten out of there.

39:01.160 --> 39:02.840
YOU IMPOSTER. WE'RE ONTO YOU.

39:06.080 --> 39:10.800
YOU'RE A FRAUD. THE REAL JENNYX IS BACK!

39:15.560 --> 39:19.000
Hello, there. It's me, Jane.

39:19.080 --> 39:20.640
I'm back now.

39:46.720 --> 39:48.240
How's the food?

39:50.800 --> 39:52.800
You must be tired after all that.

40:01.560 --> 40:02.560
Dad. Mom.

40:05.280 --> 40:06.360
Is that you?

40:07.480 --> 40:08.720
How dare you come back here?

40:11.640 --> 40:14.960
Dad, it's me, Jane.
I'm your daughter.

40:15.040 --> 40:16.240
What daughter?

40:16.320 --> 40:18.680
We only have one,
and she's sitting right here.

40:20.480 --> 40:23.280
Mom, it's me, Jane.

40:23.360 --> 40:25.760
You forced me to sell all those products

40:25.840 --> 40:27.800
and you made me eat all that bland food.

40:27.880 --> 40:28.920
Enough already!

40:29.720 --> 40:31.560
Jane has never spoken
to us like that, ever.

40:36.320 --> 40:37.800
God, the food was delicious.

40:41.360 --> 40:43.280
We're strict about Jane's diet

40:43.840 --> 40:46.240
because we know
what food she's allergic to.

40:46.320 --> 40:48.880
We would never put our daughter at risk.

40:49.480 --> 40:51.440
And we put a tracker on her

40:51.520 --> 40:54.800
because we were afraid
she would meet someone like you.

40:54.880 --> 40:59.280
We do all those things
because Jane wants us to.

40:59.360 --> 41:02.080
That's what she's always wanted
ever since she was little.

41:02.880 --> 41:06.600
Ta-da! Dad, Mom…

41:06.680 --> 41:09.040
I want to be famous.

41:09.120 --> 41:12.320
Can you two help me?

41:15.680 --> 41:19.720
That's why we do everything we do.
We want to make her dreams come true,

41:19.800 --> 41:22.880
so she can be the superstar
that she wants to be.

41:27.040 --> 41:28.720
You deceived our daughter.

41:29.280 --> 41:31.200
Are you trying to deceive us too?

41:32.640 --> 41:34.280
I'm not deceiving you.

41:34.360 --> 41:38.360
Do you two really not remember me?
I'm your daughter, Jane.

41:44.840 --> 41:45.760
But…

41:48.080 --> 41:50.320
do you remember what you said to me?

41:51.400 --> 41:54.880
"I'll be fine. I don't need my parents."

41:55.640 --> 41:59.280
"Besides, they're the ones
leeching off of me."

41:59.360 --> 42:01.160
"A family like that…"

42:01.240 --> 42:02.800
"Who needs them anyway?"

42:07.160 --> 42:09.960
If you can't even remember
what you said and what you did,

42:10.680 --> 42:12.560
how can anyone remember you?

42:14.880 --> 42:17.640
Nanno, you…

42:18.320 --> 42:19.480
You bitch.

42:21.120 --> 42:22.840
You ruined my life!

42:22.920 --> 42:25.760
-I killed you! How come you're still here?
-Stop that.

42:26.880 --> 42:28.080
Get out!

42:36.360 --> 42:37.680
I ruined it?

42:39.640 --> 42:42.000
You're the one who ruined your life.

42:43.800 --> 42:45.320
Don't you remember?

42:46.400 --> 42:48.800
You're the one who killed JennyX.

42:50.440 --> 42:54.240
Jane told us about all the horrible
things, everything that you did to her.

42:55.200 --> 42:56.920
That's right.

42:58.120 --> 43:02.840
They forced me to do all these things
that I didn't want to do.

43:02.920 --> 43:07.160
Then they tried to pretend to be me.

43:07.800 --> 43:09.480
I don't know what happened.

43:10.360 --> 43:12.520
They were both working together.

43:15.120 --> 43:16.080
Right.

43:20.760 --> 43:22.080
Please, dad.

43:23.720 --> 43:25.760
Where did we set up the camera?

43:26.920 --> 43:32.960
I want everyone
to see exactly what's happening.

43:36.600 --> 43:37.760
It's over there.

43:44.600 --> 43:46.920
DON'T LET HER GET AWAY, JANE.
WHAT'S WRONG WITH THIS BITCH?

43:47.000 --> 43:50.040
CALL THE POLICE, JANE.

43:50.120 --> 43:51.720
SHE'S PROBABLY A WANNABE.

43:51.800 --> 43:53.000
MAYBE SHE'S MENTALLY ILL.

43:53.080 --> 43:55.800
Everyone, it's me, Jane.

43:56.320 --> 44:01.200
Did you all see what happened?
What this imposter did to me?

44:01.880 --> 44:03.920
You all must help me.

44:04.520 --> 44:08.600
Please, show me your support
by sending me hearts.

44:08.680 --> 44:11.520
You can send angry emojis
to this imposter.

44:11.600 --> 44:13.880
WHY DID SHE DO THIS TO YOU? - POOR JANE.

44:14.920 --> 44:17.480
Dad. Mom.

44:17.560 --> 44:20.400
Please, it's me, Jane. I'm Jane.

44:20.480 --> 44:22.280
Don't you remember me?

44:22.360 --> 44:24.840
Are you really going to keep lying?
You're shameless.

44:24.920 --> 44:26.360
Dad.

44:27.600 --> 44:29.680
Dad.

44:31.240 --> 44:33.680
Did we call the police yet?

44:33.760 --> 44:34.800
Yes, honey.

44:40.040 --> 44:42.200
Dad. Mom.

44:54.120 --> 44:56.560
Let go! Let go!

44:56.640 --> 44:59.160
Why are you pretending to be JennyX?

44:59.240 --> 45:01.440
-Why would you do that?
-Can you give a statement?

45:01.520 --> 45:02.800
LIVE OUTSIDE JENNYX'S HOUSE

45:02.880 --> 45:05.720
Everyone, I am JennyX.

45:06.280 --> 45:08.160
-Everyone…
-It's me, Jane.

45:08.880 --> 45:10.040
I'm right here.

45:20.480 --> 45:22.520
Was I really that wrong, Nanno?

45:26.640 --> 45:28.960
Did I really deserve this at all?

45:43.840 --> 45:46.240
Was I really that wrong, Nanno?

45:48.960 --> 45:51.200
Did I really deserve this at all?

46:08.920 --> 46:10.360
You're so evil.

46:13.200 --> 46:16.440
And you, Yuri, still have a lot to learn.

46:21.680 --> 46:23.240
You're bleeding.

46:24.960 --> 46:26.480
It didn't heal?

46:29.840 --> 46:32.280
You can't answer Jane's question?

46:35.720 --> 46:38.080
Are you starting to doubt
what you're doing here?

46:44.200 --> 46:46.360
That means you're mortal now.
